    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "A language model cannot answer from your documents, because they were never in its training data. So you retrieve the right passages and hand them over.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B02",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B02.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 8.3,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B02.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B02",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:56:00"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "LIST",
      "narration_text": "Four moves. Chunk the text, embed each piece into a vector, retrieve by cosine similarity, and ground the answer in what you found.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B03",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B03.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 7.94,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B03.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B03",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:56:00"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "The search is a single matrix multiply — cosine similarity against every chunk at once. Fast, and refreshingly simple.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B04",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
